---
title: Ciclo de vida da ordem de serviço
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Received: Abrir ordem de serviço
    Received: Recebida / Received
    Diagnosing: Diagnóstico / Diagnosing
    WaitingApproval: Aguardando aprovação / WaitingApproval
    InProgress: Execução / InProgress
    Completed: Finalizada / Completed
    Delivered: Entregue / Delivered
    Cancelled: Cancelada / Cancelled

    Received --> Diagnosing: Iniciar diagnóstico
    Received --> Diagnosing: Submeter orçamento diretamente
    Diagnosing --> WaitingApproval: Submeter orçamento
    WaitingApproval --> InProgress: Cliente aprova o orçamento
    WaitingApproval --> Diagnosing: Cliente rejeita (Estimate = Rejected)
    InProgress --> Completed: Concluir todos os serviços aprovados
    Completed --> Delivered: Entregar veículo

    Received --> Cancelled: Cancelar
    Diagnosing --> Cancelled: Cancelar
    WaitingApproval --> Cancelled: Cancelar
    InProgress --> Cancelled: Cancelar
    Cancelled --> [*]
    Delivered --> [*]
